.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH "skillastic migrate" 1  "skillastic migrate " 
.SH NAME
skillastic migrate \- Migrate a skill (or \-\-all) to the current app version
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBskillastic migrate\fR [\fB\-\-all\fR] [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] [\fINAME\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Migrate a skill (or \-\-all) to the current app version
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-all\fR
Migrate every skill the resolver marks `migrate`
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Compute and print the delta without writing anything
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
[\fINAME\fR]
Skill name; omit with \-\-all
